 * A member's own device, shared with the chat's agent for reading.
 *
 * The device of a person invited to a chat (an iPhone running an app that
 * embeds Ripul, say) is never in the owner's machine room, so the chat's agent
 * cannot reach it. This is the one way it can, and it is the member's to give,
 * as with their browser (memberBrowser.ts): nothing is reachable until one of
 * their own sockets offers it (`session.deviceOffer`), the offer lives on that
 * socket alone, and it ends when that socket says so or closes, when the
 * member leaves the chat, or at the end the member set, an hour at most.
 *
